{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GbYHTJguCGrea49hhgF1fo","type":"tool_result","content":"942:- `new E.Action(name, o = {}) → action`: new E.Action(name, { body, to, other, dir, dist, top, aerial, reverse, speed: 1 }): play E.ACTIONS[name] on a body (and on o.other for a paired action). It moves them itself: run update(dt) every step instead of their physics, and feed rigState() to the rig. Each body ends standing where the action put it\n943:- `action.canCancel` †: true during a beat marked as one the action may be cut short in (spec.cancel)\n944:- `action.cancel()` †: stop now: the bodies stay where they are\n945:- `action.invulnerable` †: true while hits should miss (spec.safe: [from, to] of the action's progress)\n946:- `action.otherState(extra)` †: the rig state for the other body of a paired action (the victim of a takedown)\n947:- `action.rigState(extra)` †: the rig state for the body (merge extra over it): x, y, z, its speed, facing and the beat's pose\n948:- `action.u` †: 0..1 through the whole action\n949:- `action.update(dt)` †: move the bodies one step; returns true while the action runs (false once it has ended)\n950:- `action.beat` †: the name of the beat playing now\n951:- `action.beats` †: [[name, seconds], ...]\n952:- `action.body`, `action.other` †: the bodies it moves\n953:- `action.done = false` †: it has ended (or was cancelled)\n954:- `action.duration` †: the action's length in seconds (o.speed shortens it)\n955:- `action.name` †: the action's name\n956:- `action.o` †: the options it was given\n957:- `action.spec` †: its E.ACTIONS entry\n958:- `action.start` †: where the body was when it began\n959:- `action.t = 0` †: seconds played\n6992:  /** a paired takedown: the attacker (body) closes on the victim (o.other) from behind, strikes, and the victim drops.\n6994:  takedown: {\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174828__xe9c1ea/work","is_error":false}]