{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ToSEHDSM1BnMhqnx3TAkkv","type":"tool_result","content":"3656: *    half a keyboard each for two (Input.halfKeys: WASD with F G H R T Y on the left, the arrows with . / , L ; ' and the\n3670: *  in order, and the preset's gamepad codes (Input.halfKeys(Input.SHMUP, 'right') -> fire on . and Numpad 1, bomb on /) */\n3671:Input.halfKeys = (preset, side) => {\n3678:const _pPreset = (game, q) => q.half ? Input.halfKeys(game.input._full || game.input.preset, q.half) : (game.input._full || game.input.preset);\n3700:  const I = P[0]; if (q.half && !I.half) { I._full = I.preset; I.half = 'left'; I.use(Input.halfKeys(I._full, 'left')); }   // player 1 moves to the left half\n3774:  const I = P[0]; if (I.half && game.scene && game.scene.input) { I._full = I.preset; I.use(Input.halfKeys(I._full, 'left')); }\n468:- `game.addPlayer(o = {})` †: a player in now: { pad: index } (a gamepad) or { keys: 'right' } (the keyboard's right half; player 1 takes the left). Returns its input (null when four play already)\n471:- `game.allowJoin(o = {})` †: let players join, up to max (2..4): Start on a gamepad no one holds, or 2 on the keyboard (o.keys: false not); onJoin (input, number) as each does. allowJoin(false) closes it (the names split and join are String's and Array's)\n490:- `game.players` †: the players: [game.input (player 1), ...the ones who joined (game.allowJoin, game.addPlayer: section 10j)]; each an input with player (1..4), name ('P1'), color (E.PLAYER_COLORS) and device. A game of one: [game.input]\n491:- `game.removePlayer(p)` †: a player leaves (its input, or its number, 2 to 4); player 1 has the whole keyboard back when no one shares it\n501:- `game.splitScreen(n, o = {})` †: split the screen into n viewports (2 to 4; 0 or 1: one screen again), o: { layout: 'auto' (side by side on a wide screen, stacked on a tall one; a grid for 3 or 4) | 'columns' | 'rows' | 'grid', follow: [targets], z: 16, gap: 1 }\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174828__xe9c1ea/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"330219a3-1af8-424b-aea5-2830d09af9ad","uuid":"3473b574-ea25-4c69-8f55-5876006d9757","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:02:24.254Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"3656: *    half a keyboard each for two (Input.halfKeys: WASD with F G H R T Y on the left, the arrows with . / , L ; ' and the\n3670: *  in order, and the preset's gamepad codes (Input.halfKeys(Input.SHMUP, 'right') -> fire on . and Numpad 1, bomb on /) */\n3671:Input.halfKeys = (preset, side) => {\n3678:const _pPreset = (game, q) => q.half ? Input.halfKeys(game.input._full || game.input.preset, q.half) : (game.input._full || game.input.preset);\n3700:  const I = P[0]; if (q.half && !I.half) { I._full = I.preset; I.half = 'left'; I.use(Input.halfKeys(I._full, 'left')); }   // player 1 moves to the left half\n3774:  const I = P[0]; if (I.half && game.scene && game.scene.input) { I._full = I.preset; I.use(Input.halfKeys(I._full, 'left')); }\n468:- `game.addPlayer(o = {})` †: a player in now: { pad: index } (a gamepad) or { keys: 'right' } (the keyboard's right half; player 1 takes the left). Returns its input (null when four play already)\n471:- `game.allowJoin(o = {})` †: let players join, up to max (2..4): Start on a gamepad no one holds, or 2 on the keyboard (o.keys: false not); onJoin (input, number) as each does. allowJoin(false) closes it (the names split and join are String's and Array's)\n490:- `game.players` †: the players: [game.input (player 1), ...the ones who joined (game.allowJoin, game.addPlayer: section 10j)]; each an input with player (1..4), name ('P1'), color (E.PLAYER_COLORS) and device. A game of one: [game.input]\n491:- `game.removePlayer(p)` †: a player leaves (its input, or its number, 2 to 4); player 1 has the whole keyboard back when no one shares it\n501:- `game.splitScreen(n, o = {})` †: split the screen into n viewports (2 to 4; 0 or 1: one screen again), o: { layout: 'auto' (side by side on a wide screen, stacked on a tall one; a grid for 3 or 4) | 'columns' | 'rows' | 'grid', follow: [targets], z: 16, gap: 1 }","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174828__xe9c1ea/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01ToSEHDSM1BnMhqnx3TAkkv","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
