{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WNriwHLmGdskt4eJXBGu67","type":"tool_result","content":"559\t### 7.6 Kicking\n560\t\n561\t- **Grubber (tap ○):** along the ground 140-200 u ahead (stick aims within ±45°), `vz` 40, extra bounce chaos.\n562\t- **Punt (hold ○, release):** the meter fills in 0.9 s; distance `lerp(120, kickMax (520), power) × (0.75 + 0.03 ×\n563\t  KCK)`; apex 60-110; aimed by the stick (forward cone ±70°; no stick: straight). Over 0.9 of the meter is the \"sweet\n564\t  spot\": +8% distance and true flight; outside, a random hook of up to ±(11 - KCK)°.\n565\t- **Bomb / up-and-under (punt with the stick pulled back at release):** apex 150, distance × 0.5; it hangs, and chasers\n566\t  can contest the catch (§7.11).\n567\t- **Kick to touch:** any punt aimed across a touchline goes out where it crosses: lineout to the other team (or to the\n568\t  kicking team from a penalty, §7.12).\n569\t- **Drop goal (hold ○ inside the opponents' 22, or within 300 u of their posts and facing them):** aimed at the posts\n570\t  (the stick nudges it ±8°); power and accuracy as a punt; good if it passes between the uprights above the crossbar:\n571\t  3 points.\n572\t- **Mouse:** right button hold and release kicks toward the cursor; the landing ring is drawn where it will come down at\n573\t  the current fill; the kind follows the same rules (in their 22 facing the posts: a drop goal).\n574\t- A landing marker (a pulsing ring decal) shows where every kick will come down, for both teams.\n575\t\n576\t### 7.7 Tackling\n577\t\n578\t- **Tackle (tap ✕ without the ball):** reaches 14 u (`tackleRange`) in front (within ±70° of facing). Chance ="}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"330219a3-1af8-424b-aea5-2830d09af9ad","uuid":"7e9f3245-f646-45e4-bbd3-ac1c7973e980","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:30:17.504Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174828__xe9c1ea/work/PLAN.md","content":"### 7.6 Kicking\n\n- **Grubber (tap ○):** along the ground 140-200 u ahead (stick aims within ±45°), `vz` 40, extra bounce chaos.\n- **Punt (hold ○, release):** the meter fills in 0.9 s; distance `lerp(120, kickMax (520), power) × (0.75 + 0.03 ×\n  KCK)`; apex 60-110; aimed by the stick (forward cone ±70°; no stick: straight). Over 0.9 of the meter is the \"sweet\n  spot\": +8% distance and true flight; outside, a random hook of up to ±(11 - KCK)°.\n- **Bomb / up-and-under (punt with the stick pulled back at release):** apex 150, distance × 0.5; it hangs, and chasers\n  can contest the catch (§7.11).\n- **Kick to touch:** any punt aimed across a touchline goes out where it crosses: lineout to the other team (or to the\n  kicking team from a penalty, §7.12).\n- **Drop goal (hold ○ inside the opponents' 22, or within 300 u of their posts and facing them):** aimed at the posts\n  (the stick nudges it ±8°); power and accuracy as a punt; good if it passes between the uprights above the crossbar:\n  3 points.\n- **Mouse:** right button hold and release kicks toward the cursor; the landing ring is drawn where it will come down at\n  the current fill; the kind follows the same rules (in their 22 facing the posts: a drop goal).\n- A landing marker (a pulsing ring decal) shows where every kick will come down, for both teams.\n\n### 7.7 Tackling\n\n- **Tackle (tap ✕ without the ball):** reaches 14 u (`tackleRange`) in front (within ±70° of facing). Chance =","numLines":20,"startLine":559,"totalLines":1647}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01WNriwHLmGdskt4eJXBGu67","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
